    "question": {
      ":question/id": "2f5759e3-4fa5-5ec6-b9f7-60ba264fbbd6",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos\\left(w+2\\pi\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin w$ or $\\cos w$.\n\nUse the formula\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nand the exact values $\\cos(2\\pi)=1$ and $\\sin(2\\pi)=0$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the sum formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nWith $u=w$ and $v=2\\pi$, the exact values are $\\cos(2\\pi)=1$ and $\\sin(2\\pi)=0$. Substitute and collect the terms in the requested order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(w+2\\pi\\right)&=\\cos w\\cos\\left(2\\pi\\right)-\\sin w\\sin\\left(2\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos w\\cdot\\left(1\\right)-\\sin w\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos w.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
